            "description_html": "<b>PDQ J117 Front Door Deadbolt Function Mortise</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFront door deadbolt function mortise box for MR Series.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFront Door Deadbolt (ANSI F08 or F10): Latchbolt operated by lever from both sides. Key from outside retracts latchbolt. Toggle locks/unlocks outside lever. Key outside extends/retracts deadbolt. Inside thumbturn extends/retracts deadbolt.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Front Door Deadbolt Mortise Box:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mortise box only, no trim</li>\r\n<li>Front Door Deadbolt function</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>NOT Returnable</b>\r\n</p>",
